le bar which lives inside the `#app`. App functionality breaks if I cover that. I don't like writing hacky `calc` CSS either. In my opinion, `<teleport>` should function like that in default. It's mostly useless without that support. I know It's such a common issue since anywhere the `<teleport>` feature is introduced, people are complaining about this more than appreciating it. It's such a great feature lacking such essential and obvious functionality.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/comments/841484038/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"m4heshd","id":6711514,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MTE1MTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6711514?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4heshd","html_url":"https://github.com/m4heshd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4heshd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4heshd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4heshd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4heshd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4heshd/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4heshd/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4heshd/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4heshd/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4heshd/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":4748796149,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50NDc0ODc5NjE0OQ==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/events/4748796149","actor":{"login":"AjaiKN","id":22969541,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTY5NTQx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22969541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.co